{"at":"2026-10-20T06:50:35.811Z","event":"prompt","agent":"remakecraft:builder","by":"main","sha256":"765b0c04c42298ca8a8593d8df8994db3fdb4daa1e0fd9517e45959f4f90dd53","prompt":"Build features `cli.help` and `cli.version` of the guessling clone (a Node CLI character-encoding detector). This also fixes review must-fix M1: `--help`/`-h` and `--version` are recognised by src/args.mjs (stored in options.help / options.version) but src/cli.mjs ignores them, so the run falls through to reading stdin. Some help tests pass only by accident.\n\n- App tree: guessling (your own worktree, from current main). Read remake.json, spec/spec.json + spec/spec.md (v2), tests/visible/. Run the visible suite with `node scripts/run-suite.mjs tests/visible --bin bin/guessling.mjs` and save the passing list BEFORE changing anything.\n- Plugin root: <plugin>.\n- Layout: bin/guessling.mjs, src/cli.mjs (main returns the exit code; argError), src/args.mjs, src/usage.mjs (the two usage lines, single source), src/input.mjs, src/output.mjs, src/detect/.\n- Handle version and help in main() before any input is read, with the stream, exit code and precedence the spec states. Reuse src/usage.mjs for the usage lines in help.\n- In parallel another builder is reworking the era option and detector registry (src/args.mjs era handling, src/detect/index.mjs). Stay in src/cli.mjs plus a help-text module.\n- Scratch files go in a `.scratch/` folder inside your worktree (git-ignored), never in `.remake/`.\n- Done: every cli.help and cli.version visible test passes and no test that passed before fails (diff the lists). Commit on your branch. Report before/after counts."}
