d [text-specific].\n- Two other builders are adding the DOS/EBCDIC and Mac/always-on tiers to the same files in parallel. Keep your additions in clearly separated blocks so merges stay simple.\n- Done: your features' visible tests pass where feasible, plus related CLI tests (cli.legacy.legacy_iso_thai_to_cp874, detect.unprinted-names.tis620_thai); visible suite has no regressions (diff the lists); committed on your branch. Report before/after counts and the tests you couldn't make pass, with the reason."}
