ing the ISO/regional and Mac/always-on tiers to the same files in parallel. Keep your additions in clearly separated blocks so merges stay simple.\n- Done: your features' visible tests pass where feasible, plus related CLI tests (cli.era-option.dos_versus_default, cli.era-option.short_flag_selects_era, cli.era-value-parsing.lower_and_mixed_case, cli.era-syntax.equals_form) if they only need DOS; visible suite has no regressions (diff the lists); committed on your branch. Report before/after counts and the tests you couldn't make pass, with the reason."}
